{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-09-28 17:45:00', 'title': "FDA EXPANDS LILLY'S ERBITUX® (CETUXIMAB) LABEL WITH COMBINATION OF BRAFTOVI® (ENCORAFENIB) FOR THE TREATMENT OF BRAF V600E MUTATION-POSITIVE METASTATIC COLORECTAL CANCER (CRC) AFTER PRIOR THERAPY", 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, SEPT. 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS GRANTED APPROVAL OF A NEW INDICATION FOR ERBITUX® (CETUXIMAB INJECTION) IN COMBINATION WITH BRAFTOVI®\xa0(ENCORAFENIB), MARKETED BY PFIZER, INC., FOR THE TREATMENT OF ADULT PATIENTS WITH METASTATIC COLORECTAL CANCER (CRC) WITH A\xa0BRAF V600E\xa0MUTATION, AS DETECTED BY AN FDA-APPROVED TEST, AFTER PRIOR THERAPY.1 ERBITUX IS THE FIRST AND ONLY ANTI-EGFR ANTIBODY APPROVED, IN COMBINATION WITH ENCORAFENIB, FOR THIS INDICATION AND IS BASED ON RESULTS FROM PFIZER'S BEACON CRC TRIAL, THE ONLY PHASE 3 TRIAL TO SPECIFICALLY STUDY PATIENTS WITH PREVIOUSLY TREATED METASTATIC CRC WITH A BRAF V600E MUTATION."}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-09-28 06:30:00', 'title': 'LILLY AGAIN REDUCES LIST PRICE OF INSULIN LISPRO INJECTION AS LATEST CHANGE TO AFFORDABILITY OPTIONS', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, SEPT. 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) WILL LOWER THE LIST PRICE OF INSULIN LISPRO INJECTION IN THE U.S. BY AN ADDITIONAL 40 PERCENT EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2022, EFFECTIVELY BRINGING THE LIST PRICE DOWN TO 2008 LEVELS.'}